{"unit_id":"homily707__dsh-session-header#card-zh","repo":"homily707/dsh-session-header","commit":"79a96e6316064202c29f7d10e0d14f67f07cb753","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-header 是面向 DSH 的 JavaScript 插件：在模型调用时把当前 harness 会话 ID 写入 HTTP 请求头，并可选地为工具执行期间发往指定网关的请求加头。它通过 llm/stream 与 tools/execute 钩子结合全局 fetch 补丁工作，支持自定义头名、固定值、网关 URL 前缀白名单，以及按需覆盖已有占位头。插件默认去掉 session- 前缀；没有会话值时不注入，并在卸载时恢复原 fetch。适合需要按会话路由、缓存或审计模型网关请求的 DSH 用户。安装需要 DSH CLI 和 Node.js 22 或更高版本。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:35-67","index.js:75-83","index.js:138-183","index.js:185-229","cordis.patch.yml:13-22"]}
{"unit_id":"homily707__dsh-session-header#card-en","repo":"homily707/dsh-session-header","commit":"79a96e6316064202c29f7d10e0d14f67f07cb753","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-header adds the active DSH session ID to model request headers and can include matching tool requests. Configure the header name, fixed value, gateway URL prefixes, or placeholder headers to replace. Requires the DSH CLI and Node.js 22+.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:35-67","index.js:75-83","index.js:138-183","index.js:185-229","cordis.patch.yml:13-22"]}
