{"unit_id":"homily707__dsh-session-header#feature-llm-session-header","repo":"homily707/dsh-session-header","commit":"79a96e6316064202c29f7d10e0d14f67f07cb753","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-header 的功能「模型请求会话头」：在 llm/stream 期间，将调用会话 ID 注入 fetch 请求。默认头名为 x-session-id，剥除 session- 前缀；没有 ID 时不添加头。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:40-47","index.js:133-136","index.js:185-204"]}
{"unit_id":"homily707__dsh-session-header#feature-fixed-value","repo":"homily707/dsh-session-header","commit":"79a96e6316064202c29f7d10e0d14f67f07cb753","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-header 的功能「固定头值」：可配置自定义 HTTP 头名和固定值。设置 value 后，每个适用请求都发送该值，不再使用当前调用的会话 ID。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:40-47","index.js:133-136"]}
{"unit_id":"homily707__dsh-session-header#feature-tool-whitelist","repo":"homily707/dsh-session-header","commit":"79a96e6316064202c29f7d10e0d14f67f07cb753","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-header 的功能「工具网关白名单」：配置 toolEndpoints 后，tools/execute 期间只有匹配 origin 和路径边界的 fetch 请求带会话头，其他目标保持原样。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:49-57","index.js:87-131","index.js:206-229"]}
{"unit_id":"homily707__dsh-session-header#feature-overwrite","repo":"homily707/dsh-session-header","commit":"79a96e6316064202c29f7d10e0d14f67f07cb753","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-header 的功能「替换占位头」：默认保留请求已有的同名头；将头名加入 overwriteHeaders 后，可用当前会话值替换已有占位值，头名匹配不区分大小写。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:59-66","index.js:83-85","index.js:155-162"]}
{"unit_id":"homily707__dsh-session-header#caveat-tool-prefixes","repo":"homily707/dsh-session-header","commit":"79a96e6316064202c29f7d10e0d14f67f07cb753","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-header 使用工具执行期注入时，必须配置 toolEndpoints URL 前缀；空配置默认不为工具请求注入，未匹配前缀的第三方目标也不会带上会话头。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:49-57","index.js:206-229"]}
